    },
    "url": "https://github.com/Nu0vo1212/Rust-Frp/releases/download/v0.7.10/nfrp-windows-amd64.zip",
    "hash": "sha256:af0eb91d02d74f9380b1cb1f0e15d0af69c9a88c2b8f82432ea7de6a845bb840",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/Nu0vo1212/Rust-Frp/releases/download/v$version/nfrp-windows-amd64.zip"
    },
    "persist": [
        "frpc.toml",
        "frps.toml"
    ],
    "bin": [
        [
            "frpc.exe",
            "rustfrpc"
        ],
        [
            "frps.exe",
            "rustfrps"
        ]
    ],
    "notes": [
        "安装时把包内示例配置 frpc.toml / frps.toml 持久化到 D:\\scoop\\persist\\rustfrp，与 frp 的配置完全独立、不共用。",
        "客户端：编辑 persist\\rustfrp\\frpc.toml 后运行 rustfrpc -c D:\\scoop\\persist\\rustfrp\\frpc.toml；服务端：rustfrps -c D:\\scoop\\persist\\rustfrp\\frps.toml。",
        "shim 使用 rustfrpc.exe / rustfrps.exe，避免与 frp 包的 frpc/frps 冲突。"
    ]
